        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Misa, battling PMS and stigma, starts anew at Kurita Optics. Amidst work and sweets, she meets Takatoshi. Despite his quiet demeanor and struggle with panic attacks, a deep bond forms.",
